    "detailed_description": "Miss those good ol' days of classic retro 90's gameplay, before BOOST and the death of momentum? Feel abandoned after Mania?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roskur Does What Sonican't.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/5d0fd8948ca03c68da9f2cfe22861b19.poster.avif?t=1748467474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/5d0fd8948ca03c68da9f2cfe22861b19.webm?t=1748467474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Roskur's Run is an evolution of classic 90's &quot;Hedgehog&quot; physics-based platforming with a deeper move set, upgrades, and a non-linear world to explore. Experience a casual introduction to speed running with a unique game structure where you must shave your best times down to unlock world progression.<br>Enjoy perfect painstakingly painted pixel art in this fantasy adventure to delay Ragnar\u00f6k. Climb the world tree to warn the eagle that sits atop it about Nidhogg's approaching reptilian horde. WILL YOU MAKE IT IN TIME?!?!<br><br>Only if you wishlist! Save Midgar you distinguished gamers with skill and taste!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/9c5c9de66ba4c1b5296f6bf42f97e0ae.poster.avif?t=1748467474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/9c5c9de66ba4c1b5296f6bf42f97e0ae.apng?t=1748467474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Miss those good ol' days of classic retro 90's gameplay, before BOOST and the death of momentum? Feel abandoned after Mania?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roskur Does What Sonican't.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/5d0fd8948ca03c68da9f2cfe22861b19.poster.avif?t=1748467474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/5d0fd8948ca03c68da9f2cfe22861b19.webm?t=1748467474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Roskur's Run is an evolution of classic 90's &quot;Hedgehog&quot; physics-based platforming with a deeper move set, upgrades, and a non-linear world to explore. Experience a casual introduction to speed running with a unique game structure where you must shave your best times down to unlock world progression.<br>Enjoy perfect painstakingly painted pixel art in this fantasy adventure to delay Ragnar\u00f6k. Climb the world tree to warn the eagle that sits atop it about Nidhogg's approaching reptilian horde. WILL YOU MAKE IT IN TIME?!?!<br><br>Only if you wishlist! Save Midgar you distinguished gamers with skill and taste!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/9c5c9de66ba4c1b5296f6bf42f97e0ae.poster.avif?t=1748467474\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1058030/extras/9c5c9de66ba4c1b5296f6bf42f97e0ae.apng?t=1748467474\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
